  "goodToKnow": "Die Deckung means cover: in Deckung gehen (to take cover), Deckung geben. In finance, it's coverage or funding: Der Scheck ist ohne Deckung (the cheque bounced), die Deckung der Kosten. In insurance, it's coverage: die Deckungssumme. In sport, it's the defence or marking: die Deckung des Gegners. From decken (to cover), as in den Tisch decken (to lay the table). Deckungsgleich means congruent or identical."
